From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_hnat: fix 5G SG FPORT, WED<->EXT offload, and 4-coprocessor L7 DPI QoS

Preserve mtk_eth_soc FPORT (ext_ppe) and NETSYS v3 QID (1..63) across
scatter-gather fragments in mtk_tx_map(), bypass NAPI GRO on sent_ppd
PPE ping-pong frames, unlock bidirectional WED<->EXT offload on NETSYS v3,
prevent double QDMA loopback in mtk_sw_nat_hook_tx(), add MTU PMTU
fallback in do_hnat_ge_to_ext(), and implement simultaneous hardware EQoS
+ L7 DPI + 13-queue flow-fair SQM QDMA classification with LAN<->LAN bypass.

Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
